Built into Arachne:
- stable-diffusion.cpp (MIT), https://github.com/leejet/stable-diffusion.cpp, and ggml (MIT), https://github.com/ggml-org/ggml:
  painting from words (stable-diffusion.dll, delay-loaded).
- NVIDIA CUDA runtime libraries (cudart, cuBLAS), shipped beside it under NVIDIA's CUDA EULA (redistributable files).
- SDL2 (zlib), https://www.libsdl.org
- Dear ImGui (MIT), https://github.com/ocornut/imgui
- stb_image, stb_image_write, stb_truetype (MIT / public domain), https://github.com/nothings/stb
- nanosvg and nanosvgrast (zlib), https://github.com/memononen/nanosvg: drawing SVGs back (the PNG, the check)
- Microsoft Visual C++ runtime (redistributable files, beside stable-diffusion.dll)

Not shipped: the Krea 2 Turbo models (diffusion model, Qwen3-VL text encoder, VAE). They are fetched by Firmament or
placed by you, under their own licences.
